  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 19th level the radiant can use their own life energy to restore a slain ally to life. As a standard action, the radiant may take 6 points of essence burn to restore one creature within 60 ft. who has died within the last 10 minutes to life with half their normal maximum hit points. The creature’s body does not need to be intact but more than 50% of the corpse must be present for this ability to function.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/radiant#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
